mbers. The members range in age from 8 \u2013 50.\r\nThe group performs the Burundian dance which is an old traditional dance and was usually played for Kings. The dance should bring people together and aims to bring happiness and peace into the nation. The group\u2019s aim is to represent the Burundian culture in the national area as well as internationally. \r\nSANGW&#039;IKIYAGO.believe that traditional instruments, the Burundian drums, are a tremendous form of communication and a sign of national unity. The group wants to convey a positive message by sustaining the tradition of the community which was broken by the civil war crisis.\r\n The group have won different prizes in various regions and countries,\r\na) 12th march 2013 we emerged Number 1 in Rwanda \u2013 Kigali at FESPAD Competition( all African countries Festival )\r\nb) 28th November 2014 we again won an become Number 1 in Paris (Le Patrimoine Culturelle Immateriel de l\u2019UNESCO )\r\nc) 7th September 2017 we won again in Kampala - Uganda,Rwanda.D;) performances in US as well as in America : \r\n\r\n1)F\u00e9stival international de Louisiane (LAFAYETTE) on April 15th, 1989\r\n\r\n2) F\u00e9stival international de Louisiane (LAFAYETTE) on April 14th,1991\r\n\r\n3)Concert artistique aux Etats Unis d&#039;Am\u00e9rique plus de 20 Etats in July 1991\r\n\r\n4)F\u00e9stival international d&#039;\u00e9t\u00e9 de Quebec (Canada) on July 2and 1991.. And 5)  festival international Poland 18\/08\/2021, 2024 poland  festival Artist Traditional pozinan poland ,\u2733\ufe0f. 2025 Festival Folkore Greece,and 2025 Festival Expo tourtistique Japan,,It&#039;s pleasure to meet\r\nyou\r\nbye the way i saw this Festival Then i\r\nwould like talking with you a lot about it.We have\r\ngroup of drumming and dance  here in BURUNDI ,then we\r\nwish to contact you just talking and make\r\nrelationship\r\nOur works are known at ceremonies,weeding or\r\nfestival , conference, seminary , in different countries\r\nLook our videos and photos.https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=61565540683789\r\ni thank you and i wish your feedback.\r\nAsk me more then we would like getting your invitation we wish to particapate  thanks  .. ,,, call (+25779322103 whatsapp) email :uwimananoellaw@gmail.com.(groupsangwikiyago@gmail.com"},{"enabled":true,"required":true,"type":"radiobox","settings":{"options":[{"en":"Found on google","sw":"Kwenye Mtandao"},{"en":"Followed link from other site","sw":"Kutoka Mitandao Mingine"},{"en":"From Friends","sw":"Kutoka kwa Marafiki"}],"layout":"vertical"},"name":{"en":"<p>How did you find us?<\/p>","sw":"<p>Umepataje Taarifa Zetu?<\/p>"},"default":{"en":"","sw":""},"answer":"Followed link from other site"},{"enabled":true,"required":true,"type":"checkbox","settings":{"options":[{"en":"I agree to the Terms and Conditions","sw":"Nakubaliana na Vigezo na Masharti"},{"en":"I want to receive newsletters","sw":"Napenda Kupata taarifa za mara kwa mara"}],"layout":"vertical"},"name":{"en":"<p>Confirmation:<\/p>","sw":"<p>Thibitisha:<\/p>"},"default":{"en":"","sw":""},"answer":["I agree to the Terms and Conditions"]}]}
